            "value" : "24 timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A line in the panel when the battery won't last through a meeting, the Mac uses more power than usual, or a new app uses a lot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En linje i panelet, når batteriet ikke holder et møde igennem, Mac'en bruger mere strøm end normalt, eller en ny app bruger meget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little more than usual. A Mac asleep should use about 1% an hour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lidt mere end normalt. En Mac i dvale bør bruge ca. 1 % i timen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A normal sleep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En normal dvale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification naming the app using the most energy, with a button to quit it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, der nævner den app, der bruger mest energi, med en knap til at afslutte den."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification on waking when the Mac used much more battery asleep than it should." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når Mac'en vågner, hvis den har brugt meget mere batteri i dvale, end den burde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when AirPods, a Magic Mouse or another accessory needs charging." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når AirPods, en Magic Mouse eller andet tilbehør skal oplades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when an app keeps using a lot of power on battery for a while, with a button to quit it. Not for the app you're using." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når en app bliver ved med at bruge meget strøm på batteri, med en knap til at afslutte den. Ikke for den app, du bruger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notification when the battery reaches a level, to unplug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En notifikation, når batteriet når et niveau, så du kan tage strømmen fra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slice for the power no app accounts for: the screen, graphics, Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth and macOS itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En bid for den strøm, ingen app står for: skærmen, grafikken, Wi‑Fi, Bluetooth og macOS selv."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft glow flows into the battery while it charges, here and in the panel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Et blødt lys strømmer ind i batteriet, mens det oplader, her og i panelet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ca. %@ tilbage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ more than at this time on most days, mostly because of %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ca. %1$@ mere end på dette tidspunkt de fleste dage, mest på grund af %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ more than at this time on most days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ca. %@ mere end på dette tidspunkt de fleste dage."
