          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding at %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder på %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds the battery at this level while plugged in, so it lasts longer. macOS keeps it, even when WatchMyBattery isn't running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holder batteriet på dette niveau, mens strømmen er tilsluttet, så det holder længere. macOS husker det, også når WatchMyBattery ikke kører."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hourly summaries, a few kilobytes a day. Insights always look at the last two weeks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opsummeringer for hver time, nogle få kilobyte om dagen. Indsigter ser altid på de seneste to uger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Show Your iPhone or iPad" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sådan viser du din iPhone eller iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hungriest App" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mest energikrævende app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@, about %lld times faster than usual. Something may be waking it: open the panel to see what's keeping it awake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "På %1$@, ca. %2$lld gange hurtigere end normalt. Noget vækker den måske: åbn panelet for at se, hvad der holder den vågen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "In %1$@, about %2$lld times faster than usual. Something may be waking it: open the panel to see what's keeping it awake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@. A Mac asleep should use about 1%% an hour. Open the panel to see what's keeping it awake." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "På %@. En Mac i dvale bør bruge ca. 1 %% i timen. Åbn panelet for at se, hvad der holder den vågen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
