    "Low Power Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strømsparetilstand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode makes it last longer, by reducing energy use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strømsparetilstand får det til at holde længere ved at bruge mindre energi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode Without a Password" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strømsparetilstand uden adgangskode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode, battery health and charging, in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strømsparetilstand, batteritilstand og opladning i Systemindstillinger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS holds the limit itself, so it stays on when WatchMyBattery isn't running. It's the same setting as in System Settings › Battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS holder selv grænsen, så den gælder, også når WatchMyBattery ikke kører. Det er den samme indstilling som i Systemindstillinger › Batteri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is still calculating the time left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS beregner stadig den resterende tid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maximum capacity is how much charge the battery holds compared with when it was new. A charge cycle is using 100% of its capacity, in total, not necessarily all at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maksimal kapacitet er, hvor meget strøm batteriet kan rumme i forhold til, da det var nyt. En opladningscyklus er, når 100 % af kapaciteten er brugt i alt, ikke nødvendigvis på én gang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measures for a couple of seconds, then gets the name of the app using the most energy. Apps hidden in WatchMyBattery's settings are left out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Måler i et par sekunder og henter derefter navnet på den app, der bruger mest energi. Apps, der er skjult i WatchMyBatterys indstillinger, medtages ikke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring its processes…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Måler dens processer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menu Bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menulinje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More Than Usual" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mere end normalt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Much more than a sleep should use. Usually something kept waking the Mac: a Bluetooth device, Wake for network access in System Settings › Battery, or an app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meget mere, end en dvale bør bruge. Som regel blev Mac'en ved med at blive vækket: af en Bluetooth-enhed, Vågn ved netværksadgang i Systemindstillinger › Batteri eller en app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a Mac with Apple silicon and macOS 26.4 or later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kræver en Mac med Apple silicon og macOS 26.4 eller nyere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs Battery History, in Settings › Panel." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kræver Batterihistorik under Indstillinger › Panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
